# BizTrack Nigeria - Environment Configuration
# This application is an offline-capable Progressive Web App (PWA) with local persistent storage.
# No environment variables are strictly required to deploy and run the prototype on Vercel.

# Optional future Supabase / API backend credentials (leave empty if using local storage):
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
